    "scope": "Scoped Windows validation for new opt-in actual index conflict inspection and early readonly CLI dispatch: full library plus20 Git/capture/scope/editor/process integration targets, all-target Clippy, Python and mandatory TypeScript checks. No HostGit/shared Store/source-scope implementation changes. Whole-native, hosted/platform, wider semantic/upstream and full STATUS acceptance remain separate."
  },
  "findings": [
    "Explicit host index-read and Git-trust admission precede existing-readonly Store access. Current native snapshot/lineage/path scope plus independent Git-source permission is mandatory for stage-body reads. Neither imported snapshots nor derived wrappers around foreign origins confer local Git authority; captured readonly dependency paths remain readable without write permission.",
    "Two matching bounded NUL-delimited unmerged listings and object-format observations preserve every stage occurrence. SHA1/SHA256 raw blob hashes, original UTF8/CRLF bytes and stage-specific offsets are checked before bounded preview/page output. Symlink/gitlink/tree stages remain metadata; protected paths and unsafe text are omitted explicitly. No working source, canonical CAS body, other worktree source path, network, model or state write is introduced.",
    "Twelve real Git/SQLite/CLI cases cover actual merges, epochs8/9, SHA1/SHA256, all7 constructed stage-presence patterns, per-worktree linked indexes, clean indexes, stale exact pages, source/cache/path separation, readonly dependencies, native Git/overlay and foreign lineage, budgets, SQL transaction/policy restoration, permissions and exact stdout envelopes. Seven separately labeled private protocol tests are included in full-library counts rather than added again.",
    "A genuine foreign-snapshot scope regression failed before the native-origin closure correction. Exact red source copies/log/hash manifest precede the fix. Earlier development also preserves one compile-only temporary-borrow fixture error, three calibration/Windows fixture failures, and an interrupted compile with no claimed result. The first frozen preflight refuses two test-style Clippy findings before any functional gate; initializer and borrowed-slice fixes do not change runtime behavior.",
    "Eighteen additional actual CLI host-path/protocol cases use the exact frozen final binary. Valid limits/page controls reach existing-state refusal; relative, parent, device/ADS and real junction paths, duplicate/missing/unknown/authority-bearing JSON, oversized host files and hard-max violations refuse before Store creation or stdout. Counts are separate from Cargo totals.",
    "An actual duplicate-page JSON CLI test exposed a marker mismatch: malformed input was denied with the general safe JSON parser error instead of git_conflicts_input_invalid. The exact pre-fix source and actual failing harness/log are retained. Parsing now maps both strict parsing and typed decode errors to the same fixed public marker; a direct malformed/duplicate/unknown/invalid-UTF8/oversize regression covers the boundary. No authorization bypass or input-value disclosure was observed.",
    "Selected validation is not a whole-native run. Prior whole-native Windows symlink prerequisites, hosted platform acceptance, compiler override/dispatch identity, inferred conflict causes, predicted merge safety, working-file resolution, pushed-ref freshness, area classification, remaining full STATUS functionality and upstream/release certification stay open. No main merge, release, live App installation or public comment is claimed."
  ],
